<title>SOUTH AFRICA: YABENG HALF YR SHR SHARPLY DOWN, NO DIV.</title>
<headline>YABENG HALF YR SHR SHARPLY DOWN, NO DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Aug 31 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     2.1	   vs 19.4</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.32	  vs 11.94</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   7.72 loss   vs 9.96 profit</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.35 credit vs 0.76 charge</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   11.33	 vs 5.21</p>
<p>    Turnover		  227.43	vs 116.97</p>
<p>Full name: Yabeng Investment Holding Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Share of associates'  1.35	  vs 2.93</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they expected modest year-on-year</p>
<p>growth as the negative impact of the recent interest rate hike</p>
<p>on its financial interests was offset by anticipated better</p>
<p>performances from its food interests.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
